    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the Sanctum of the Lost Archmage, a crumbling tower suspended in the starry expanse of an astral plane. The air hums with latent arcane energy, and glowing runes drift like dust motes in the twilight. Before you vanished, Archmage Vael left behind a complex web of magical apparatuses, each connected by invisible threads of power. Your only hope of returning to the mortal realm is to navigate this intricate magical array and ultimately ignite the legendary Creation Forge. To do so, you must understand the flow of magic, gathering offerings, deciphering forgotten glyphs, and tracing the connections between these ancient relics. Explore the sanctum, let the devices guide your path, and unravel the ultimate spell.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
